{"summary":"灯盏即油灯盏，性味不详。民间方术认为，上元节偷富家灯盏置于床下可助孕求子。","sections":[{"kind":"names","title":"释名","original":"（《纲目》）\n\n缸。","translation":"灯盏，又名缸。"},{"kind":"form","title":"集解","original":""},{"kind":"preparation","title":"修治","original":""},{"kind":"properties","title":"气味","original":""},{"kind":"uses","title":"主治","original":"上元盗取富家灯盏，置床下，令人有子（时珍。《韵府》）。","translation":"在上元节（正月十五）偷取富贵人家的灯盏，放在床底下，能使人怀孕（李时珍引自《韵府》）。"},{"kind":"commentary","title":"发明","original":""},{"kind":"prescriptions","title":"附方","original":""}],"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E6%9C%AC%E8%8D%89%E7%B6%B1%E7%9B%AE%2F%E6%9C%8D%E5%99%A8%E9%83%A8#燈盞","retrievedAt":"2026-07-05T14:00:40.129Z"}